    "The use of **steroids, decongestants, and antihistamines not recommended**.",
    "**Myringotomy**, performed to drain infected middle ear fluid in the presence of complications (e.g., mastoiditis, labyrinthitis, or facial paralysis) or to allow purulent middle ear fluid to drain into the ear canal for culture.",
